From b232aa59ee64b5b580b567dee73fd1ef368b6770 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: anyingiit <49945850+anyingiit@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 18:41:21 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat: add --json flag to stats command

`sentrysearch stats --json` prints the index stats as a single JSON
object with the keys backend, model, total_chunks, unique_source_files,
source_files and missing_files, so scripts can consume it (e.g.
`sentrysearch stats --json | jq .total_chunks`). An empty index still
yields a valid object with zero counts and empty lists. The default
human-readable output is unchanged.

Closes #62
